WEBVTT

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:10.410
There's no reason to have
such an uneasy look on your face, second one.

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.540
I'm a specialist.

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:15.670
Though times have changed,
as a warrior,

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:18.170
I don't ignore signatures
left by those in the trade.

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:25.550
"This is my prey, so hands off."

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:28.930
A sign used among specialists
to mean something along those lines.

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:33.440
As long as that's there,
I can't raise a hand against you.

00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:35.440
If you didn't have that...

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:42.070
There's no way I'd let a vampire live,
even for a moment.

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:43.820
IT WAS WORTH GETTING STOMPED ON
BY A LITTLE GIRL.

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:45.570
Here should be fine.

00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:50.830
We can take our time to chat here.

00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:57.590
I believe your name was Koyomi Araragi?

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:00.840
I guess I should call you Sir Araragi.

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:05.840
I'll be straightforward, Sir Araragi.

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:10.350
I want you to break up with Kiss-shot.

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:12.290
OWARIMONOGATARI

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:15.620
SHINOBU MAIL, PART FIVE

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:20.880
My objective is...

00:02:21.630 --> 00:02:22.880
Kiss-Shot.

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:26.880
To make amends with the one
you call Shinobu Oshino.

00:02:27.090 --> 00:02:28.760
M-Make—

00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:29.640
Amends.

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:33.930
I ended things with Kiss-shot
with an argument.

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:39.270
A momentary delusion caused me
to hurl some inconsiderate words at Kiss-shot.

00:02:40.770 --> 00:02:43.780
I'd like to apologize for that
and seek her forgiveness.

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:45.900
And like we did in the past...

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:47.650
I'd like to fight apparitions
together with her.

00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:53.660
As beautiful as a goddess...
so beautiful that your spine freezes...

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:57.210
I'd like to protect her back,
and be the sword that fights for her.

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:02.040
You may not understand, but...

00:03:03.630 --> 00:03:08.300
I can't help but think you're only saying that
to get close to Shinobu to get revenge.

00:03:08.550 --> 00:03:12.140
Revenge? What revenge
is this revenge you speak of?

00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:15.180
Are you saying I have a reason
to hold a grudge against her?

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:16.730
A reason to hold a grudge...

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:18.440
There is.

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:22.980
Don't fool yourself by saying
something like "a momentary delusion."

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:25.690
You said some really harsh words to Shinobu.

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:30.240
Yes, I won't deny that part.
That's why I want to apologize.

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:32.950
I want to see her in person and apologize.

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:37.950
She only needs to have one minion.

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:43.250
She brought me back from near death.

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:46.340
I was upset at the time,
but nowadays, I truly appreciate it.

00:03:48.590 --> 00:03:51.840
Is what I'm saying all that strange?

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:59.270
<i>The fact he's saying it feels strange.
But I can't deny the statement itself...</i>

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:02.600
<i>Because I've basically done the same thing.</i>

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:05.360
I guess you wouldn't want to break up.

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:11.030
However, anyone can be your replacement,
but nobody can replace me.

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:15.410
Because I'm special. I'm the chosen one.

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:19.620
I idolize lines like that.
I'd like to say something like that for once...

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:23.330
It's way too presumptuous, though,
so I'd never be able to say it.

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:34.010
Sparks flying between us will benefit no one.

00:04:34.430 --> 00:04:39.770
In the end, this is just like
two men fighting over one woman.

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:44.020
A fight between two minions is something
not even apparitions would gobble up.

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:55.700
Then what should we do?

00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:57.490
Are we going to praise each other
from now on?

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:59.660
That would be such a hideous sight.

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:02.580
Therefore, I shall propose
something of merit for you.

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:08.000
Sir Araragi, I'll let you know what benefits
you'll see if you break up with Kiss-shot.

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:14.510
Meanwhile, you can think about what benefits
I'll see if you don't break up with Kiss-shot.

00:05:15.090 --> 00:05:17.970
M-Merit? Benefits?

00:05:17.970 --> 00:05:23.020
If you break up with Kiss-shot for me,
you'll be liberated from Kiss-shot.

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:28.060
In other words, all the responsibility
that you feel for Kiss-shot right now

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:30.730
can be placed on none other
than my shoulders instead.

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:35.240
I did relay your message.

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:40.490
She didn't seem to have any intention
of seeing you, though.

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:45.000
I see. Well, I guess that's how it would be.

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:52.880
But well, no matter what Kiss-shot's intention is,
I need her to return what I lent her.

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:55.880
My sword, and my position.

00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:02.100
I want to flourish once again.

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:05.140
After these 400 years,
I want to sparkle one more time.

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:08.900
I don't find this to be disgraceful.

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:15.900
Don't you want to flourish again,
not as Shinobu's minion, but as a human?

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:19.700
The fact that you want to see Shinobu,
even if revenge wasn't the objective,

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:21.280
perhaps you want to be human.

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:23.790
I can no longer return to being human.

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:27.750
It's been 400 years after all.
Too much time has passed.

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:30.960
Looking at things from that perspective,
I'm different from you.

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:36.300
Well, I no longer see it
as something sad.

00:06:36.300 --> 00:06:39.840
Because I can't make it in time,
that's why I can, for half an eternity,

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:42.100
spend my time with Kiss-shot.

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:47.190
You may be thinking
that's something similar to pure love...

00:06:47.190 --> 00:06:50.810
But in modern society,
people like you are called "stalkers."

00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:54.530
As I said, let us stop insulting each other.

00:06:54.530 --> 00:06:56.860
Besides, have you thought of anything?

00:06:57.280 --> 00:07:02.620
If you don't break up with Kiss-shot,
what benefit will there be for me?

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:20.720
You shouldn't drink something given to you
by the enemy without doubting it first.

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:24.060
If you were tricked into drinking holy water,

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:28.060
even though your pairing is severed for now,
you'd be a goner.

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:30.770
Totally makes me laugh.

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:36.360
Looks like we've been interrupted, Sir Araragi.

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:39.820
The story would've progressed much faster

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:43.620
if you had drank the goblet of poison,
or rather, the chalice.

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:47.290
It wouldn't have been ignoring
the signature on you, either,

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:49.830
if you were purified by your own will.

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:53.130
Don't get upset, minion of Heart-under-blade.

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:56.340
When it comes to defeating apparitions,
anything goes.

00:07:56.340 --> 00:07:59.340
Foul play and ambushes
are among the proper methodologies.

00:08:04.720 --> 00:08:08.140
Looks like we made it in time. Good.

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:10.190
Nice to meet you, first one.

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:13.310
I'm Izuko Gaen.

00:08:13.770 --> 00:08:16.940
A big sister that knows everything.
I came here to negotiate with you.

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:21.200
Sir Araragi, it seems our conversation
has come to an end.

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:24.120
I shall excuse myself now.

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:27.540
We couldn't find
a point of compromise between us.

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:31.960
In this case, our relationship
must move to the next phase.

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:33.460
Conversation?

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:35.840
It's time to duel.

00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:39.210
Tonight, we fight to the death.

00:08:41.090 --> 00:08:44.640
I'll leave the logistics
to those specialists over there.

00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:49.390
Until then, I'll try to recover to as close
to maximum potential as possible.

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:53.350
Sir Araragi, you should get the signature
removed from your face.

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:55.440
I won't run, nor will I hide.

00:08:58.020 --> 00:08:58.610
Ru—

00:08:59.860 --> 00:09:01.610
WHY AREN'T EPISODE AND GAEN GOING AFTER HIM?

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:09.580
Th-That's not what it looks like!

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:13.790
BRA        DONUTS
BOOK         BOOK

00:09:25.220 --> 00:09:26.220
BRA        DONUTS
BOOK         BOOK

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:30.890
Devil boy, shh.

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:32.810
O-Ononoki...

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:35.020
By the time I got here,
things were already like that.

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:39.610
They were already like that?

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:44.860
Hey.

00:09:45.070 --> 00:09:47.530
I'll admit you've got some nerve.

00:09:47.530 --> 00:09:50.660
The courage you show by not taking
even one step back while facing me

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:53.870
makes me think satisfactorily of you
as my master's underclassman.

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:58.960
So I won't be emotional,
and as an adult that has lived for 500 years,

00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:01.050
I'll be very tolerant of a brat.

00:10:01.630 --> 00:10:04.670
If you're willing to take back
what you said earlier,

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:07.640
I can forget the various exchanges
that have gone on here.

00:10:08.180 --> 00:10:11.260
If you apologize, I'll forgive you.

00:10:11.930 --> 00:10:13.770
I won't take it back. I won't apologize.

00:10:14.100 --> 00:10:15.270
I'll say it again and again.

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:17.650
Shinobu. You should meet him.

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:21.940
You should go meet that first apparition killer!

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:40.630
To end things without seeing your previous partner,
who's revived after 400 years of trying...

00:10:40.630 --> 00:10:42.460
That's not a good thing.

00:10:42.460 --> 00:10:44.210
That's a terrible thing.

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:46.720
That isn't the right thing to do.

00:10:50.140 --> 00:10:52.890
I have no idea what you're talking about.

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:58.770
If, as a human, you want to lecture me,
speak with at least a smidgeon of logic.

00:10:58.770 --> 00:11:00.270
Like I know anything about logic!

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:03.020
You should stop making excuses
and go see him!

00:11:03.020 --> 00:11:06.860
This man spent 400 years reviving himself
just so he could see you!

00:11:06.860 --> 00:11:08.150
Why won't you meet with him?

00:11:08.150 --> 00:11:11.570
I've been telling you,
you've misunderstood.

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:16.160
He didn't revive due to
that sort of silly emotional reason.

00:11:16.370 --> 00:11:20.380
The dispersed ashes gathered
and became excited, as if they were magnets.

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:21.420
It's a natural phenomenon.

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:24.920
The feeling of falling in love
with someone is natural, too!

00:11:25.340 --> 00:11:27.920
Don't deny someone's
feelings of love for you!

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:29.180
I'm telling you...

00:11:30.930 --> 00:11:35.100
You really don't get it at all!
It really is nothing like that.

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:36.600
A vampire's minion...

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:38.810
The vampire master/servant relationship

00:11:39.230 --> 00:11:44.610
isn't something you speak of
in terms of love or hate, you romance-brain!

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:49.320
"The master/servant relationship
isn't about love or hate."

00:11:49.570 --> 00:11:52.450
Can you say that
in front of Araragi-senpai as well?

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:57.950
It's just like what I told my master back then.

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:03.080
For me as I am now, the only partner
I can call my minion is your upperclassman.

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:04.670
For my current self...

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:10.680
Shinobu, you say you don't understand
what I'm saying.

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:12.970
But that's what I don't understand.

00:12:12.970 --> 00:12:16.100
What I don't like about all of this
is that right there.

00:12:20.350 --> 00:12:24.730
You make it sound as if
you're only allowed to have one minion.

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:29.070
For instance, isn't it possible for you,
Araragi-senpai and that first apparition killer

00:12:29.070 --> 00:12:32.070
to get along amiably as a trio?

00:12:32.240 --> 00:12:33.780
As a trio?

00:12:35.740 --> 00:12:39.660
What, are you being cheeky
and saying we should make amends?

00:12:39.870 --> 00:12:42.420
I don't care if you make amends or not.

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:48.670
If you're saying you'd choose Araragi-senpai
over the first apparition killer, that's fine.

00:12:48.670 --> 00:12:52.050
But you have to be the one
that tells him that.

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:55.550
You shouldn't rely on Izuko or Araragi-senpai
to convey the message to him for you.

00:12:55.890 --> 00:12:58.010
You don't know anything
about the situation.

00:12:58.260 --> 00:13:00.350
You don't know about
my relationship with him.

00:13:00.350 --> 00:13:06.560
No, you probably don't even know anything about
my relationship with my current master, do you?

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:11.070
It's true that I don't. But I can tell.

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:15.280
About the feelings of being the first one,
and of being the second one.

00:13:17.870 --> 00:13:21.790
<i>In Kanbaru's mind, the first apparition killer's
feelings resonate more with her.</i>

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:24.790
<i>The feeling of paranoia...
as if it was pure love.</i>

00:13:25.290 --> 00:13:29.420
Even if I were to see him now,
there's nothing I can say to him.

00:13:31.130 --> 00:13:33.510
Look at reality, monkey-girl.

00:13:33.510 --> 00:13:38.100
Now that he's basically the tale of apparitions
that fill this town nowadays,

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:40.180
he has no choice
but to become prey for the specialists.

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:42.060
I know that. That's why—

00:13:42.060 --> 00:13:43.230
That's why?

00:13:43.230 --> 00:13:45.810
That's all the more reason
for me to go see him, you say?

00:13:46.350 --> 00:13:48.900
That man harbors a grudge against me.

00:13:49.190 --> 00:13:51.570
If I see him, I may be killed.

00:13:51.570 --> 00:13:54.030
Apparently he's asking for me
to return the demon blade.

00:13:54.030 --> 00:13:57.870
The ones to get slain by that blade
may not only be us.

00:13:57.870 --> 00:13:59.530
With all that in mind—

00:13:59.530 --> 00:14:02.540
With all that in mind,
I'm telling you that you should go see him.

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:05.540
That's why logic doesn't matter at all!

00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:08.750
Why do people refuse
to see others like that?

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:09.790
It's complete nonsense!

00:14:10.170 --> 00:14:13.920
Everything's complete nonsense
unless someone goes and meets someone else!

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:15.680
You can't make any stories that way!

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:19.050
You should just be blunt
and say it, Shinobu.

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:21.470
That you're scared.
That you're scared of seeing him.

00:14:22.060 --> 00:14:24.980
That you don't want your emotions swayed
by meeting with and talking to him.

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:31.570
You feel that seeing him
is like betraying Araragi-senpai,

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:33.690
so you don't intend
to see him ever again.

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:36.820
But that's not true.

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:40.330
The only one you're betraying is yourself.

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:44.700
You should just tell him

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:48.170
that a love that takes 400 years to return
is too heavy for you.

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:53.800
That you're troubled to see him return to life
now that you're doing well with Araragi-senpai.

00:14:54.170 --> 00:14:56.550
That his feelings are nothing but a nuisance.

00:14:56.930 --> 00:14:59.180
That he should've just stayed dead.

00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:03.890
Just say it. If you can't say that...

00:15:03.890 --> 00:15:06.230
Don't speak about masters
and lords and stuff.

00:15:06.430 --> 00:15:08.900
That's not being aloof, nor is it noble.

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:11.520
You're simply being bashful.

00:15:15.530 --> 00:15:17.530
What's with a master and servant relationship?

00:15:18.110 --> 00:15:21.660
You don't have the right to own a slave,
nor the right to serve under a master.

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:22.910
Ka...

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:25.910
You have no right to form a relationship.

00:15:26.710 --> 00:15:27.410
Ka ka.

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:34.250
Why interlock the fingers?

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:36.380
Whoa, made a mistake.
Thought you were Senjyogahara.

00:15:36.760 --> 00:15:38.130
You're the worst.

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:41.010
Hold on just a bit longer, Ononoki.

00:15:41.010 --> 00:15:42.970
Why? The situation is already pretty bad.

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:44.100
Even so.

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:47.180
Ka ka ka.

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:48.690
Ka ka ka.

00:15:49.270 --> 00:15:51.600
Do you want those to be
your dying words?

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:56.820
I feel like crushing your head right now,
even if it makes everything for naught.

00:15:57.530 --> 00:15:58.950
Do it, then.

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:00.950
I'm not going to apologize.

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:05.120
Do it, and then you can start to feel awkward
with Araragi-senpai.

00:16:05.120 --> 00:16:07.870
Just like how you're avoiding
the first apparition killer right now,

00:16:07.870 --> 00:16:09.960
you're going to start avoiding
Araragi-senpai.

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:13.290
Just like how you made him
a story of your past,

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:16.880
you can turn Araragi-senpai
into a story of the past, in the future.

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:20.970
Like how you dismissed the first one,
you'll someday dismiss the second one.

00:16:20.970 --> 00:16:24.680
You can't face the first one directly,
so there's no way you can with the second one.

00:16:24.890 --> 00:16:28.890
Or the third one, the fourth one, the fifth one.
You can keep saying goodbye to people forever.

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:30.350
Forever...

00:16:30.640 --> 00:16:34.650
You're immortal, right?
Araragi-senpai said that at some point.

00:16:34.810 --> 00:16:39.030
"If Shinobu is going to die tomorrow,
I'm fine with my life ending tomorrow."

00:16:39.570 --> 00:16:42.780
But I'm sure you wouldn't
say something like that.

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:45.950
Even if you did...
You'd say the same thing to the third one.

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:48.410
And the fourth one. And the fifth one.

00:16:48.580 --> 00:16:52.370
You'll continue to say it forever,
and continue to live on forever.

00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:59.510
Don't think that being sociable like you
is a trait everyone has.

00:16:59.510 --> 00:17:02.180
Earlier, you stated
I was simply being bashful...

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:06.050
But isn't the feeling that
you don't want to see anyone also natural?

00:17:06.050 --> 00:17:07.680
That's unnatural.

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:10.230
It's possible that someone
won't get along with others,

00:17:10.230 --> 00:17:11.810
but it's never that they
don't see anyone.

00:17:11.810 --> 00:17:13.440
I'm not human.

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:16.440
That might be, based on how you're acting.

00:17:19.400 --> 00:17:23.950
Even if I were to see him, you realize
there's nothing I can say to him right now?

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:28.160
We parted harboring hatred, and we parted
by death harboring hatred. That's our relationship.

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:32.910
I have no intention of getting back together,
and I have no intention of making a friendly trio.

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:36.170
I've no intention of lining the first one
and second one up to talk about them.

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:40.840
I feel that the act of comparison
in of itself is rude to my master.

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:47.720
What meaning is there in showing
how amiable I am with my master right now?

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:52.230
By showing that man
I have no feelings for him now whatsoever...

00:17:52.390 --> 00:17:56.230
What meaning is there?
You wish for me to do something so cruel?

00:17:56.940 --> 00:17:59.980
Yeah. I'm telling you to do something cruel.

00:18:00.190 --> 00:18:02.860
It's your job to hurt the man from your past.

00:18:04.780 --> 00:18:08.280
You want to be liked, and on top of it,
stay a good person?

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:10.370
You want to end everything being loved?

00:18:10.910 --> 00:18:12.660
What you're saying...

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:18.000
That's like saying if something is going to erode
or be worn down, it's better to just destroy it.

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:19.750
That's what I've been saying!

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:25.680
If he holds a grudge against me
and is trying to kill me,

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:28.010
that means I'll kill him in return.

00:18:28.430 --> 00:18:29.890
You're still fine with that?

00:18:29.890 --> 00:18:31.140
That's still fine.

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:34.930
If that's the case, then you can
respond to his feeling of hatred.

00:18:34.930 --> 00:18:37.100
You can sever him from those feelings.

00:18:37.350 --> 00:18:39.860
But, if you apologize
and he forgives you, in that case...

00:18:39.860 --> 00:18:42.030
It's the same thing even then.

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:46.660
The moment he forgives me,
he'll be exterminated by a specialist.

00:18:47.070 --> 00:18:48.530
You're still fine with that?

00:18:48.780 --> 00:18:50.030
That's still fine.

00:18:50.530 --> 00:18:51.530
That's still fine!

00:18:54.870 --> 00:19:00.170
If your silly assumptions are correct
and he revived himself thinking of me...

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:02.710
I'd be able to respond to his feelings.

00:19:02.710 --> 00:19:07.550
What I can do by meeting him
is to harshly and roughly dump him.

00:19:07.930 --> 00:19:09.550
You're still fine with that?

00:19:10.600 --> 00:19:11.550
That's still fine.

00:19:12.010 --> 00:19:17.020
If I met him, and felt like I wanted
to respond to his feelings, then what?

00:19:17.020 --> 00:19:21.190
What would you do if I chose the first apparition killer
instead of your upperclassman?

00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:22.940
You're still fine with that?

00:19:22.940 --> 00:19:24.190
That's still fine.

00:19:25.070 --> 00:19:26.190
If that's the case...

00:19:26.530 --> 00:19:29.490
If that's the case,
make a clean break with Araragi-senpai,

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:32.080
and you can live happily ever after
with that guy.

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:42.090
<i>I have, for the first time,
seen Shinobu Oshino lose a one on one battle.</i>

00:19:44.050 --> 00:19:45.130
Ononoki.

00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:46.590
I have a favor to ask you.

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:50.090
Can you take this stamp off of me?

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:56.850
If I take that off, I won't be able
to ensure your safety anymore, you know?

00:19:57.890 --> 00:20:00.480
I want to try out this "duel" thing.

00:20:04.480 --> 00:20:06.480
Are you done with
all the formalities or whatever?

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:08.490
Yeah, of course.

00:20:08.860 --> 00:20:11.490
She definitely knows
her business in that respect.

00:20:11.490 --> 00:20:16.160
After all that, she tracked down
the first apparition killer and properly negotiated.

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:20.500
Where's the location for this duel
that you guys set up for us?

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:23.000
Where do I need to go tonight?

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:25.130
Oh, that's...

00:20:25.130 --> 00:20:27.840
A place that's very familiar to you.

00:20:28.630 --> 00:20:31.590
And it's a place deeply connected to me, too.

00:20:31.590 --> 00:20:32.510
Deeply connected?

00:20:33.300 --> 00:20:36.310
The courtyard of Naoetsu Private High School.

00:20:38.680 --> 00:20:42.730
<i>After that fierce encouragement from Kanbaru,
Shinobu's next action...</i>

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:45.360
<i>was to pout and take a nap.</i>

00:20:45.770 --> 00:20:48.320
<i>She withdrew deep into the shrine building.</i>

00:20:48.820 --> 00:20:53.030
<i>The fact that a high school girl refuted her
seems to have gotten to her more than expected.</i>

00:20:56.160 --> 00:20:59.870
Huh? Kanbaru, what's wrong?
What are you doing lying there?

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:03.380
Your head's bleeding. Are you okay?

00:21:04.330 --> 00:21:07.750
Araragi-senpai, you were watching until
a few minutes ago, so you know everything, right?

00:21:07.960 --> 00:21:09.260
You found me out!

00:21:10.380 --> 00:21:13.550
It's fine. Shinobu didn't notice.

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:17.260
So, Araragi-senpai, did you buy the book
I asked you to get me?

00:21:17.260 --> 00:21:18.720
BRUTAL GARÇON HUFF-HUFFS A HALF-BLOOD BOY!

00:21:18.720 --> 00:21:20.850
You're too obsessed with that book.

00:21:20.850 --> 00:21:23.060
Just how important is this book you wanted?

00:21:23.060 --> 00:21:24.730
At least show me the wound on your head.

00:21:30.740 --> 00:21:32.400
<i>Well, I guess it'll be all right.</i>

00:21:33.150 --> 00:21:35.410
Now, let's eat lunch, Kanbaru.

00:21:35.410 --> 00:21:39.870
Then, I'll just read my book here like this,
so Araragi-senpai, please feed me.

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:41.250
Aah!

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:45.460
Don't "aah'" me. No upperclassman
would spoil someone that much.

00:21:45.460 --> 00:21:46.380
What about Shinobu?

00:21:50.880 --> 00:21:53.340
So, Araragi-senpai, what about the bra?

00:21:53.340 --> 00:21:54.550
I bought one for you. Here you go.

00:21:54.550 --> 00:21:55.800
BRA

00:21:56.050 --> 00:22:00.060
Then, I'll just read my book here like this,
so Araragi-senpai, you can put it on for me.

00:22:00.270 --> 00:22:01.310
Aah!

00:22:01.310 --> 00:22:03.440
You totally changed the meaning of "aah" there!

00:22:05.230 --> 00:22:05.940
Kanbaru.

00:22:06.190 --> 00:22:08.020
By any chance,
do you have something for me?

00:22:08.860 --> 00:22:10.940
Like, some advice
you'd risk your life to give me.

00:22:13.150 --> 00:22:15.450
If anything, DIY.

00:22:16.110 --> 00:22:17.030
"DIY"?

00:22:18.070 --> 00:22:20.990
"Do your best." So yeah, do your best!

00:22:21.750 --> 00:22:24.040
<i>Abbreviating that would be DYB.</i>

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:24.370
DIY = SUNDAY CARPENTERS

00:22:24.370 --> 00:22:27.250
<i>I thought DIY was "Do it yourself,"
like a weekend carpenter.</i>

00:22:27.250 --> 00:22:29.540
<i>But I didn't press the issue.</i>

00:22:30.210 --> 00:22:32.550
<i>Because, "Do it yourself"...</i>

00:22:32.840 --> 00:24:20.187
<i>...being told I should do it myself was,
in this case, very fitting advice for me.</i>
